sequenceDiagram
  participant User as Requester
  participant Api as Application
  participant Policy as Policy engine
  participant Approver as Authorized approver
  participant Tool as Mutating tool
  participant Audit as Audit store
  User->>Api: Propose action
  Api->>Policy: Validate arguments risk and permissions
  Policy-->>Api: Approval required or denied
  Api->>Audit: Persist proposed action and policy decision
  Api-->>Approver: Present exact action summary
  Approver->>Api: Approve reject or let expire
  Api->>Policy: Reauthorize exact approved action
  Policy-->>Api: Execute only if still valid
  Api->>Tool: Execute idempotent action
  Tool-->>Api: Verified outcome
  Api->>Audit: Persist final outcome
  Api-->>User: Show verified completed failed or cancelled state
